{"vid":"Wo6cVnJZ28M","source":"Wo6cVnJZ28M.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"So, you were into welding and fab before"},{"t":1.4,"txt":"you got into the cars. Yeah. What What"},{"t":3.8,"txt":"What did you originally think you were"},{"t":5.4,"txt":"going to go to to go to school to do?"},{"t":7.4,"txt":"What was your original"},{"t":8.3,"txt":">> Um"},{"t":9,"txt":"maybe fabricating trucks or something"},{"t":11,"txt":"like that. How did How did you end up"},{"t":12.9,"txt":"getting into drift cars? I was into like"},{"t":16.3,"txt":"street cars and actually my friend took"},{"t":19.1,"txt":"me to the drift track and I was like,"},{"t":20.9,"txt":"\"Oh, this is kind of neat. I've never"},{"t":22.2,"txt":"really seen this before.\" And then he's"},{"t":24.8,"txt":"like, \"Hey, you should drive my car.\" I"},{"t":26.8,"txt":"was like, \"No, I don't want to drive"},{"t":27.8,"txt":"your car, you know, like oh, I'll crash"},{"t":29.8,"txt":"or whatever.\" And he's like, \"No, just"},{"t":31.2,"txt":"drive it. Like I don't care. Go.\" And"},{"t":33.1,"txt":"so, he gave me the keys and I went and"},{"t":35,"txt":"as soon as I did the first turn in it, I"},{"t":37.4,"txt":"was like, \"Oh, this is cool.\" And it was"},{"t":40.4,"txt":"a SN95 Mustang that was pretty beat."},{"t":44.4,"txt":"I went and bought a drift car the next"},{"t":46.3,"txt":"day, actually, and been doing it ever"},{"t":48.3,"txt":"since."},{"t":49,"txt":">> Yep."},{"t":49.9,"txt":"I I I got the same problem. I fall in"},{"t":51.8,"txt":"love with hobbies really quick and can"},{"t":53.3,"txt":"tend to go go like full full bore into"},{"t":55.9,"txt":"it and go get everything you need for"},{"t":57.2,"txt":"the hobby and do that for a while and"},{"t":59.1,"txt":"then jump into something else. Full"},{"t":60.6,"txt":"throttle"},{"t":61.8,"txt":"in everything. I mean, a lot of people"},{"t":63,"txt":"get into welding or, you know, they sign"},{"t":64.5,"txt":"up for welding school and they have no"},{"t":65.9,"txt":"idea what they want to do and, you know,"},{"t":68.1,"txt":"it's it's cool that you can kind of mix"},{"t":69.6,"txt":"those two passions together and and"},{"t":72.1,"txt":"build a career and a life out of it."},{"t":73.5,"txt":"Yeah, the the past I would say five or"},{"t":76.2,"txt":"so years it felt like I I haven't even"},{"t":78.9,"txt":"worked a day, you know, the whole time."},{"t":80.5,"txt":"It's just all felt like this"},{"t":82.4,"txt":"I'm just out there doing what I love."},{"t":83.8,"txt":">> That's the goal, man. They say if you do"},{"t":85.1,"txt":"what you love, you'll never work a day"},{"t":86.2,"txt":"in your life."},{"t":86.8,"txt":">> Yep, exactly."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"So,"},{"t":0.16,"w":"you"},{"t":0.28,"w":"were"},{"t":0.36,"w":"into"},{"t":0.56,"w":"welding"},{"t":0.8,"w":"and"},{"t":0.92,"w":"fab"},{"t":1.16,"w":"before"},{"t":1.44,"w":"you"},{"t":1.56,"w":"got"},{"t":1.72,"w":"into"},{"t":1.88,"w":"the"},{"t":2,"w":"cars."},{"t":2.92,"w":"Yeah."},{"t":3.32,"w":"What"},{"t":3.56,"w":"What"},{"t":3.76,"w":"What"},{"t":3.84,"w":"did"},{"t":4,"w":"you"},{"t":4.2,"w":"originally"},{"t":4.96,"w":"think"},{"t":5.2,"w":"you"},{"t":5.28,"w":"were"},{"t":5.36,"w":"going"},{"t":5.48,"w":"to"},{"t":5.56,"w":"go"},{"t":5.68,"w":"to"},{"t":6.4,"w":"to"},{"t":6.52,"w":"go"},{"t":6.64,"w":"to"},{"t":6.76,"w":"school"},{"t":7,"w":"to"},{"t":7.08,"w":"do?"},{"t":7.44,"w":"What"},{"t":7.56,"w":"was"},{"t":7.68,"w":"your"},{"t":7.84,"w":"original"},{"t":8.32,"w":">>"},{"t":8.32,"w":"Um"},{"t":9,"w":"maybe"},{"t":9.4,"w":"fabricating"},{"t":10.08,"w":"trucks"},{"t":10.52,"w":"or"},{"t":10.64,"w":"something"},{"t":11,"w":"like"},{"t":11.16,"w":"that."},{"t":11.88,"w":"How"},{"t":12.12,"w":"did"},{"t":12.24,"w":"How"},{"t":12.32,"w":"did"},{"t":12.52,"w":"you"},{"t":12.64,"w":"end"},{"t":12.76,"w":"up"},{"t":12.92,"w":"getting"},{"t":13.12,"w":"into"},{"t":13.72,"w":"drift"},{"t":14,"w":"cars?"},{"t":14.52,"w":"I"},{"t":14.64,"